# Electron Conventions

## IPC Channel Naming
Use descriptive, action-oriented names:

```javascript
// ✅ GOOD
ipcMain.handle('run-grep', async (event, pattern, directory) => {})
ipcRenderer.invoke('get-projects')

// ❌ BAD  
ipcMain.handle('grep', async (event, data) => {})
ipcRenderer.invoke('projects')
```

## Preload Script Separation
- `preload.js` — Shrine renderer only
- `panel-preload.js` — All panel renderers

```javascript
// ✅ In panel HTML files
<script src="panel-preload.js"></script>

// ✅ In index.html only
<script src="preload.js"></script>
```

## Window Management
- Main shrine: Fixed 200×200, never resize
- Panels: Separate BrowserWindows, positioned 8px right of shrine

```javascript
// ✅ Panel positioning
const [shrineX, shrineY] = mainWindow.getPosition()
panelWindow.setPosition(shrineX + 208, shrineY)
```